(occupancy. No further movement.   Days 3 to 5 - 30 March to 02 April 2024   Coverage continued on the same schedule. The pattern of brief warehouse visits in the morning followed by a return to the residence repeated daily. On 31 March a third party \(male, late twenties, riding a black motorcycle\) made a brief visit to the warehouse around 13:20 and departed within ten minutes. On 01 April the subject vehicle did not leave the residence; static observation confirmed continuous occupancy by the primary subject.  On 02 April at 08:42 the subject vehicle departed for the warehouse on the established pattern. The vehicle was not observed to return by the end of the surveillance period at 22:00. Coverage was stood down at 22:00 in accordance with the operation order. A summary disposition report follows separately.  ) Tj
